{"sections":[{"slug":"权","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"权"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">权</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“权”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示</span>, $\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的线性泛函</span>.</p>\n<p>$V$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">权</span></strong> (weight) $\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的权空间定义为</span>\n$$\r\nV_\\lambda = \\{ v\\in V \\colon  \\forall H\\in \\mathfrak h, Hv=\\lambda (H) v\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">根</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的伴随表示</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">此时的权称为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":" (root).</p>\n"}]}}}]}